    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/calligraphy-greenway-hotel/hotel/taichung-tw.html",
    "name": "Calligraphy Greenway Hotel",
    "detail": "Pros: -Room was very spacious and clean. Sofas and mattress were super comfortable. -excellent location. Lots of places to see within walking distance. Several convenience stores are nearby. Cons: -it's a weird design that the only sink is placed in the living room, not beside the toilet. So if you wish to wash your hands after doing your business you need to walk over the the living room or wash your hands in the shower. Oh and there's no hook/rack to hang up drying towels near the sink. -Parking is at a nearby commercial building's basement and hotel guests are only allowed to park at floor B4- B6 which is annoying given there were a lot of empty spots on the upper floors. Parking fee is TWD 200/ day but only until 12 noon the next day which is the same as check out time. -Skip the breakfast, unless you're only looking to grab something to eat quickly.",
